flowchart TD
    requestIn[用户需求输入] --> intentJudge[解析意图]
    intentJudge --> needClarify{需求明确?}
    needClarify -->|否| askClarify[提出澄清问题]
    askClarify --> userConfirm[确认目标输出]
    userConfirm --> routePlan[选择子智能体]
    needClarify -->|是| routePlan
    routePlan --> dispatchTask[派发任务]
    dispatchTask --> mergeCheck[汇总与质检]
    mergeCheck --> finalReply[统一交付]
